aro Pennygood</a> at the <a href=\"/wiki/Facemaker%27s_Boutique\" title=\"Facemaker's Boutique\">Facemaker's Boutique</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>     <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"3D_Preview\"> 3D Preview </span></h2>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://faeruncolors.com/#dye=dark-amethyst\">Full-screen 3D model preview</a> on <i>FaerûnColors</i>\n</p><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><details class=\"bg3wiki-dye-preview\"><summary><span>Embed 3D model preview</span></summary>\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\" width=\"280\" height=\"500\" style=\"border:none\" src=\"https://faeruncolors.com/embed/dark-amethyst?compact\" title=\"Dark Amethyst 3D preview\"></iframe></details> \n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h3>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 334px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 332px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dark_Amethyst_-_Sample.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Examples of dye on various materials.\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Dark_Amethyst_-_Sample.png/498px-Dark_Amethyst_-_Sample.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2d/Dark_Amethyst_-_Sample.png/746px-Dark_Amethyst_-_Sample.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/2d/Dark_Amethyst_-_Sample.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Examples of dye on various materials.\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Dark_Amethyst_-_Sample.png/498px-Dark_Amethyst_-_Sample.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"332\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2d/Dark_Amethyst_-_Sample.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"> Examples of dye on various materials.</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached